# Repository Structure

**Project**: FermentFlow (.NET DDD reference application)

> **Single Source of Truth**: For complete structure and naming conventions, refer to [docs/01_repository-structure.md](../../docs/01_repository-structure.md).

## Quick Summary

- **`docs/01-overview/`**: Project overview, domain, architecture evolution, running locally
- **`docker/`**: Local infrastructure (MongoDB, EventStoreDB, RabbitMQ)
- **`src/`**: Application source — structure varies by git branch
- **`tools/psscripts/`**: Maintenance and CI helper scripts
- **`.github/`**, **`.cursor/`**: CI, agent skills, and assistant governance

## Branch-dependent source layout

| Branch | Source layout |
|--------|---------------|
| 01–03 | `src/FermentFlow.sln` — monolith or modular monolith |
| 04 | `src/Sales/FermentFlow.Sales.sln`, `src/Warehouses/FermentFlow.Warehouses.sln` |

Always confirm the active branch before editing project paths or solution references.

## Preserved archives

- `.archive/` (if present) contains old layouts — leave as legacy unless explicitly asked to migrate.
